      "content": "SP 90 SW                   CHARTRIDGE           ASHERIDGE                                                 (west side) 5/5                                             Barn and attached outbuilding                                                 at Tiles Farm to north-                                                 west of farmhouse - GV                                              II Barn and attached outbuilding. C18.  Timber framed on brick plinth, weatherboarded, old tile roof.  Projecting gabled cart entry on yard side with lean-to outshed on left.  Lower range attached on right. Interior: 3-bay barn with straight braces to tie beams carrying curved queen posts.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9422504106"
    }
